            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2809-09, Disc Double Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Disc Double Hook straddles is a fashionable way to add utility to any bathroom. This Modern Disc Double Hook Bath Hooks is handy for a wide array of uses. The Modern Bathroom Double Hook is most obviously used as a bath towel hook, but it can also be install in restrooms as a purse hook, a robe hook, or a hand towel hook in both residential or commercial settings. Choose from a wide array of finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Disc Bathroom Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Hook Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 robe hook and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
